   "claims": [
    "Cubic Yard to Cubic Foot Conversion Table By Joe Sexton Joe is the creator of Inch Calculator and has over 20 years of experience in engineering and construction.",
    "Since one cubic yard is equal to 27 cubic feet, you can use this simple formula to convert: cubic feet = cubic yards × 27 The volume in cubic feet is equal to the volume in cubic yards multiplied by 27.",
    "For example, here's how to convert 5 cubic yards to cubic feet using the formula above.",
    "There are 27 cubic feet in a cubic yard, which is why we use this value in the formula above.",
    "1 yd³ = 27 ft³ Cubic yards and cubic feet are both units used to measure volume.",
    "For example, 1 cubic yard can be written as 1 yd³, 1 cu yard, 1 cu yd, or 1 CY.",
    "For example, 1 cubic foot can be written as 1 ft³, 1 cu foot, 1 cu ft, or 1 CF."
   ],
